My brother and his crazy stunts.

275
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,820
Come on, we're moving up.

276
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,100
Is that a good idea?

277
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:49,560
I think so.

278
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:52,980
Every time he's pulled one, it seems to have been the right choice.

279
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,340
Pull them closer!

280
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:05,420
One left.

281
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,180
Get directly behind it.

282
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,460
No armor on their tails.

283
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:15,000
The engines are vulnerable.

284
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:18,140
Honor 6, two more headed in.

285
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:21,140
Course 175, fly parallel to the coast.

286
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:23,280
Yuki, do you copy?

287
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:25,640
What, you only remember us when you need help?

288
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:27,140
Maintain that heading!

289
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:41,120
Bodhis, Merex, Renove, and Halifas, and Rome, and Vine?

290
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,120
How dare you have hurt them?

291
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,580
My children!

292
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:47,720
We'll fire simultaneously.

293
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:48,620
Roger.

294
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:51,060
You leave me no choice!

295
00:17:51,060 --> 00:18:06,780
It just flew away.

296
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:10,320
Crack!

297
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:11,820
Hold on, what was that?

298
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:13,020
I have no idea!

299
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:15,620
It gained distance again.

300
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:16,460
Here it comes!

301
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:18,180
Shoot it to knock it off course!

302
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,240
It's too big for my rifle to move it.

303
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,400
I'm too heavy!

304
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:22,840
With you aboard, I can't maneuver!

305
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,600
Now I'm going to crush you!

306
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:30,140
It's gaining on us, Bat!

307
00:18:30,180 --> 00:18:31,760
Just keep quiet, will you, Orange?

308
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,380
This isn't a game!

309
00:18:39,780 --> 00:18:41,980
To lose our altitude, he stalled out?

310
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:47,660
It's back again.

311
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:48,780
I've got to level out!

312
00:18:48,780 --> 00:18:51,260
Well, that trick won't work twice!

313
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,180
It's over for you.

314
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:02,880
What was that?

315
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:18,660
What the?

316
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:34,020
What is that?

317
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:38,620
A flying ship?

318
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:39,820
It's more.

319
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:41,700
It's a flying battleship.

320
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:43,480
It's a flying battleship.

321
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,380
Yes, I found you!

322
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:49,940
Princess of Salem!

323
00:19:50,620 --> 00:19:51,220
Impossible!

324
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:54,680
The Terrans have no access to all of Noah.

325
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,500
How could they have such a thing?

326
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:59,260
Enemy craft at 12 o'clock and closing rapidly.

327
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:00,560
Collision course!

328
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:12,680
You filthy Terrans!

329
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:15,340
All right, brace yourself for impact!

330
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:24,360
Damn you all!

331
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:25,480
I am still!

332
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:31,660
For the death of my father.

333
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:34,100
All Martians will pay the price.

334
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,580
We did it!

335
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:40,480
That was close!

336
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:40,760
That was close!

337
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:46,460
Princess of Salem!

338
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:48,340
I found you at last!

339
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:50,900
Your princess was dead.

340
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,880
But still...

341
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:55,980
You kept looking for her.

342
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:57,120
Huh?

343
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:00,780
You knew that the princess was really alive.

344
00:21:01,780 --> 00:21:02,680
But how?

345
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:05,160
What do you mean?

346
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:07,100
Answer me.

347
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:10,160
Take me to see her highness.

348
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,440
Answer my question first.

349
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,520
Just a minute.

350
00:21:17,140 --> 00:21:19,040
Are you intending to exploit her too?

351
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:22,040
If she is exploited...

352
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:23,960
Is that a problem?

353
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:28,160
What are you saying?

354
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:46,360
Just tell me!

355
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:47,940
Are you saying that you're my enemy?

356
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:54,360
You...

357
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:58,160
Are my enemy.

358
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,220
It doesn't happen.

359
00:22:04,220 --> 00:22:05,300
Yes!

360
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:10,740
Would you!

361
00:22:22,420 --> 00:22:23,300
I'm sorry!

362
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,920
You see!

363
00:22:30,920 --> 00:23:00,900
Thank you.

364
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:30,900
Thank you.

365
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:32,920
Thank you.

